body:
`SCIMUserSchema` allows the enterprise extension object (`[SCIM_SCHEMAS.ENTERPRISE_USER]`) to be present even when `schemas` does not include `SCIM_SCHEMAS.ENTERPRISE_USER`. Add a refinement to require the extension URI whenever the extension attribute object is provided (to keep payloads RFC 7643-compliant).
```suggestion
    .describe('Enterprise user attributes'),
}).superRefine((data, ctx) => {
  const hasEnterpriseExtension = data[SCIM_SCHEMAS.ENTERPRISE_USER] != null;
  if (!hasEnterpriseExtension) {
    return;
  }

  const schemas = Array.isArray((data as any).schemas) ? (data as any).schemas as string[] : [];
  if (!schemas.includes(SCIM_SCHEMAS.ENTERPRISE_USER)) {
    ctx.addIssue({
      code: z.ZodIssueCode.custom,
      path: ['schemas'],
      message: `schemas must include "${SCIM_SCHEMAS.ENTERPRISE_USER}" when enterprise user extension attributes are present`,
    });
  }
```
